# A Luxel library scene — Apache-2.0. Grammar: library/README.md.
# A marquee: a dim black band across a softened aurora and a message
# crawling along it. Edit the T line to change the words, or make it
# `T slot 0` to set them from outside (POST /api/text, Home Assistant).
S - Scrolling Message
U 32 32
L pat 0 0 0 0 normal 70 none fill 1
N Aurora
I @pat/aurora-2d
L color 0 10 0 12 normal 60 none fill 1
N Band
L text 0 12 0 0 normal 100 black fill 1
N Message
T lit HELLO FROM LUXEL
F regular ffd9b0 l left 18
